==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**12 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Sanzo Cat]] makes this stage extremely easy with a stack of him alongside some meatshields. [[Cyborg Cat]], [[Elemental Duelist Cat]], and [[Maximum the Fighter]] are also very helpful for this stage, mainly for handling J.K. Bun Bun. [[Ring Girl Cat]]/[[Pizza Cat]] can be used to easily take care of the Gory Darks. Crazed/[[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is also very good for crowd control in this stage. Pizza Cat and Cyborg Cat also take care of the Aku Doges easily.

